    "summary": "Spend 1 CP and 1 Pain token in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) or the opponent's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Pick a **DRUKHARI** unit of yours that is a target of at least 1 of those attacks.\n\nUntil the enemy unit finishes attacking, each attack aimed at your unit has its Armour Penetration worsened by 1. When the phase ends, add 1 Pain token to your pool if your unit is **HAEMONCULUS COVENS** and remains on the battlefield.",
